% Problem 4. Chace vol. II pl. 36 (photograph X, register 5; photograph IX, N.Y. Historical Society fragments), PDF pp. 119-120; Peet pp. 52-53 (pl. F).
No. 4
"{The making of loaves 7} for man 10."
Multiply 2/3 '30 by 10.      % "Make thou: 2/3 '30 times 10"
"there result 7."            % Peet: "result [7]" (restores the 7; Chace reads it)
"The producing of the same:"
  [1]   2/3 ['30]            % Peet: [1 2/3 '30] (2/3 also restored; Chace reads it on a N.Y. fragment, fn 4)
\ [2]   [1] '3 '15           % Chace: tick present on a N.Y. fragment (fn 5), '3 on a N.Y. fragment (fn 6); Peet: [\2 1 '3] '15 (tick and '3 restored)
  4     2 2/3 '10 30         % 30 for '30; Chace: "The scribe has omitted the fractional dot in the '30 in the multiplication."
\ 8     5 '2 '10
Total 7.                     % "Total loaves 7; ..."
"it, this is."
